{
  "slug": "warm-potato-and-mackerel-salad",
  "title": "Warm Potato and Mackerel Salad",
  "blurb": "A simple salad of tender boiled potatoes and flaked mackerel with fresh tomatoes",
  "steps": [
    "Put the halved potatoes in a pan of cold salted water and bring to the boil.",
    "Cook for 12 to 15 minutes until tender when pierced with a knife, then drain and leave to cool slightly.",
    "Drain the mackerel and break it into large flakes with a fork, discarding any bones or skin.",
    "Put the warm potatoes in a serving bowl with the diced tomatoes and flaked mackerel.",
    "Drizzle over the olive oil and lemon juice, season with salt and pepper, then toss gently to combine."
  ],
